msgstr ""

msgid "Require that only 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' or 'multipart/form-data' body is accepted for the token verification to proceed. Disable this property for the CSRF filter to avoid verifying the token for POST requests with other content types. This property is only effective if `verify-token` property is enabled and `token-header-name` is not configured."
